  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges Radio Apps publication platform          public service</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Radio publication platform for public     service - SR public service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att Radio Republik Indonesia ska ha en plan f&#xf6;r utrullning av en mobilplattform med applikationer, som i sin tur - d&#xe5; den genomf&#xf6;rts- v&#xe4;ntas leda till &#xf6;kad demokratisk dialog p&#xe5; nationell niv&#xe5;. RRI ska ocks&#xe5; genom projektet ha f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad kapacitet, b&#xe5;de     teknisk och institutionell, att genomf&#xf6;ra sj&#xe4;lva utrullningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected result of the project is that Radio Republik Indonesia   will have depeloped a plan for rolling-out of a mobile platform,      which in the future is expected to have led to an improved and        increased democratic dialogue at national level. RRI will also at the end of the project period have aquired the necessary technical and    institutional capacity to be able to implement the plan</narrative>
  </description>
